rust-proxmox-io (1.3.0-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * request zeroed memory instead of manually clearing it

  * avoid potential null dereference and memory leak on error path

  * remove boxed::uninitialized because it is unsound and unused

  * remove unused append_to_vec functions, they could leak uninitialized memory
    to callers

  * remove unused ByteVecExt trait with grow_ and resize_uninitialized

  * propagate OOM errors to avoid crashing and fix potential UB in
    read_exact_allocated by not passing uninitialized memory to arbitrary
    readers

  * replace vec::uninitialized in skip_to_end with explicit zeroing, and remove
    the now unused helper

 -- Proxmox Support Team <support@proxmox.com>  Thu, 05 Nov 2026 09:57:47 +0100

